        "summary": "DEFAULT_FREEBUFF_MODEL_ID in common/src/constants/freebuff-models.ts changed from FREEBUFF_DEEPSEEK_V4_PRO_MODEL_ID to FREEBUFF_KIMI_MODEL_ID. This updates the initial model selection for new sessions. Scope limited to shared core constants.",
