      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you open a new chat session, the assistant will now default to the Kimi model instead of the DeepSeek V4 Pro model that was used before. This change takes effect immediately for new sessions you start, so your very first message in a fresh chat will be handled by Kimi unless you manually switch to a different model. The adjustment only modifies which model is pre-selected at startup and does not affect your access to other available models or any ongoing conversations. Other smaller updates arrived alongside it, including a renaming of an ad-banner component and a replacement of an older model option in the free model picker.",
